    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Yehu ka ɲininka Yehonadab fɛ",
      "rationale": "Yehu bɛ Yehonadab ɲininka k'a laninkɛ dusukun ɲɛmanyɔrɔ la"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "A tagara yen na, a ye ⟨את⟩ Yehonadab, Rekab den, ye — min bɛ na a fɛ — a y'a duba, a ko a ye: Yala i dusukun bɛ ɲɛman don, n dusukun bɛ i dusukun fɛ cogo min na? Yehonadab ko: Ɔwɔ, ɔwɔ dɔrɛn. A ko: Ni o tiɲɛ ye, i bolo di. A ye a bolo di, a y'a Tulon a fɛ, a wataro kɔnɔ.",
